**Why not STANDS.** The measurement itself does stand. The pin equals the PDG print, and every later value is within 0.18 ppm of it. But the result as the tree uses it (v, lambda and alpha_W from G_F) holds only under the tree-level G_mu-scheme hypothesis, which the owners do not name. For alpha_W the owner's own READ source uses a different definition. The drift is real, and computed rather than asserted.

